{"last_link_id": 30, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [30], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-6.046945571899414, 274.24755859375], "widgets_values": ["齐静春的死，是一场多方势力共同编织的“阳谋”。他的死，既是三教为了维护既有秩序而进行的“清洗”，也是他为守护小镇百姓、反抗不公天道而做出的主动牺牲。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [28], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-6.822499752044678, 541.0924072265625], "widgets_values": ["\"Female, around 26 years old, warm mature narrator voice in a calm mezzo-soprano to contralto range, smooth and grounded timbre with gentle lower-mid resonance, medium speaking pace, naturally placed pauses, and fluid connected phrasing; breath support is steady, composed, and unhurried, articulation is clear but soft-edged, vowels are rounded, warm, and relaxed, consonants are precise without sharpness, with subtle breath resets between sentences that create a reassuring narrative rhythm without interrupting continuity. Emotionally kind, patient, thoughtful, and quietly expressive, as if she is telling a meaningful story from lived experience, maintaining a close, trustworthy presence and a gentle warmth suitable for long listening.\""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [942.3079833984375, 252.22222900390625], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs